		tool: "gm.graph.eliminate_dead_code(); gm.recompile()",
		lang: "python",
		code: "def forward(self, x, y):\n    add = torch.sub(x, y);  x = y = None\n    mul = torch.mul(add, 2);  add = None\n    relu = torch.relu(mul);  mul = None\n    return relu\n",
		marks: [[1, "swap"]],
